      "price": "",
      "traits": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Whiskey",
      "quantity": 1,
      "description": "<p>Alcohol is a common substance available in stunning variety. The Price of a dose of alcohol depends on the specific beverage. You can't recover from the sickened condition from alcohol while affected.</p>\n<p>If you fail a saving throw against alcohol other than initial saves, the affliction's stage doesn't increase; the only way to increase the stage of alcohol's affliction is to consume more alcohol.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <img src=\"assets/images/actions/1.png\" title=\"1 action\" alt=\"1 action\"> Interact (Ingested)</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 12 Fortitude save</p>\n<p><strong>Onset</strong> 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> +1 item bonus to saving throws against fear (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> Off-Guard, +1 item bonus to saving throws against fear effects (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> Clumsy 1, off-guard, Stupefied 2 (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> clumsy 2 and Sickened 2 (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> clumsy 2, sickened 2, and stupefied 2 (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 6</strong> Unconscious (8 hours)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 7</strong> death</p>",
      "level": 0,
      "price": "1 cp",
      "traits": [
        "alchemical",
        "consumable",
        "drug",
        "ingested",
        "poison"
      ]
    }
